PETSELFTEST1
# V9 parrot voices without a person: open the parrot from the play menu
# (Sound page), turn the dial to the robot (3 turns) and hold the dial centre
# for a take, then the echo (1 turn) and a second take, then the home slot
# (1 turn) and a press to leave. Each take records the room for about 1.5 s
# into RAM only and plays it back in the chosen voice; the log carries the
# voice NUMBER and sample counts, never audio. Counted from "mark begin".
# Needs: outside the quiet hours (phase day), battery above the low level.
# expect min:PET_SOUND_START 1
# expect min:kind=parrot 1
# expect min:PET_PARROT_VOICE 2
# expect min:voice=3 1
# expect min:voice=4 1
# expect min:PET_PARROT_PLAY 2
# A turn while it plays is not part of this scenario.
# expect none:PET_PARROT_STOP 0
# expect none:PET_SOUND_REFUSED 0
# expect none:PET_PARROT_PLAY_FAILED 0
# expect none:PET_SELFTEST_ABORT 0
# expect selftest_done 1
# expect max_partial_ms 2500
# expect max_full_ms 5000
phase day
volume 15
waitidle 60000
pet
wait 6000
# Normalize restored pet state to "home, neutral".
tap press 6000
hold press 1500 6000
mark begin
# Rail Story(1) -> Game(2), press: first level; Sound page (3 turns, press),
# the parrot is its 3rd card (2 turns, press).
tap down 2500
tap press 6000
tap down 600
tap down 600
tap down 600
tap press 3000
tap down 600
tap down 600
tap press 6000
# Voices: parrot(0) -> chipmunk -> bear -> robot(3).
tap down 1500
tap down 1500
tap down 1500
hold press 1500 8000
wait 6000
# Echo(4).
tap down 1500
hold press 1500 8000
wait 8000
# Home slot(5): a press leaves, nothing is recorded.
tap down 1500
tap press 3000
wait 6000
pet
wait 5000
end
